{"pageid":5117,"title":"Chantarelle mushroom","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Chantarelle mushroom</span>","revid":21727,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/1/14/Chantarelle_mushroom.png/revision/latest?cb=20260531095351\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Chantarelle mushrooms captured growing on the sides of acacia trees.\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/1/14/Chantarelle_mushroom.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20260531095351\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"83\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Chantarelle mushroom.png\" data-image-key=\"Chantarelle_mushroom.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Chantarelle_mushroom.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">Chantarelle mushrooms captured growing on the sides of acacia trees.</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>The <b>chantarelle mushroom</b> is a type of mushroom that usually grows on the sides of <a href=\"/wiki/Acacia\" title=\"Acacia\">acacia trees.</a> One chantarelle mushroom will sell for exactly <b>$100.</b>\n</p><p>It is characterized by 5 smaller mushrooms growing in a clump with typically 1-3 spawning on each acacia tree. The item is not edible, nor can it be used to fill schematics. \n</p><p>It is reccomended to use a variant of <a href=\"/wiki/Grabbiest_Grabber\" title=\"Grabbiest Grabber\">grabber tool</a> to pick these off the tree, as they are quite small and come in bunches together for easy transporting.\n</p><p>These are also based off of the real, (<b>edible!)</b> counterpart! however it has poisionous look-alikes, so be careful.\n</p>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/20/Real_life_chantarelle_mushrooms.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20260531095716\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Real-life chantarelle mushrooms, which they are based off.\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/20/Real_life_chantarelle_mushrooms.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20260531095716\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"239\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Real life chantarelle mushrooms.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Real_life_chantarelle_mushrooms.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Real_life_chantarelle_mushrooms.jpg\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">Real-life chantarelle mushrooms, which they are based off.</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903115747\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.008 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.011 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 1/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:5117-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260903115747 and revision id 21727. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories":[],"links":[{"title":"Acacia","exists":true},{"title":"Grabbiest Grabber","exists":true}],"images":["Chantarelle_mushroom.png","Real_life_c